<title>POLAND: Okocim Q2 net falls to PLN 8.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Okocim Q2 net falls to PLN 8.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Okocim preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     12.71  vs    16.44</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 15.62  vs    19.71</p>
<p>    net profit				8.71  vs    10.58</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Okocimskie Zaklady Piwowarskie Okocim SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     100.19  vs    74.71</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 51.56  vs    37.58</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.08  vs     0.02</p>
<p>    income tax				6.91  vs     9.13</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   24.34  vs   148.35</p>
<p>    financial costs			21.35  vs   145.06</p>
<p>    investment			     15.53  vs    11.92</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     17.08  vs    23.86</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 23.70  vs    25.08</p>
<p>    net profit			     12.15  vs    13.77</p>
<p>    net sales			     157.41  vs   108.19</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 84.33  vs    55.23</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.03  vs     0.04 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			     11.55  vs    11.31</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   46.40  vs   148.38</p>
<p>    financial costs			39.81  vs   147.13</p>
<p>    investment			     23.05  vs    21.53</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
